,"alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"置物がすごく可愛かったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮っちゃいました(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は、お仕事帰り一人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美術館へ行ってきました( *^_^* )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、すごく大好きで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とくに西洋美術にとても興味を持っています＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「  ドビュッシー、音楽と美術 ー 印象派と象徴派のあいだで  」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身、吹奏楽をずっとやってきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラシックとか西洋の芸術音楽が大好きなんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フランスを代表する音楽家、ドビュッシーの生誕150年を記念して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オルセー美術館、オランジュリー美術館、ブリヂストン美術館が共同開催する展覧会ということで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり興味深いものがあり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな音楽と、美術のクロスオーバーを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に行きたい！と思っていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見に行けて、嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドビュッシーが生きた19世紀～20世紀初頭のフランスを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肌で感じることができて、面白かったし、楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして、絵を見たあとで音楽を聴くと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し変わってくるのかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また色々と聴いてみようと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の素晴らしい品々を拝見することが出来て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"厳かで美しい 世界観に癒されて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心が洗われた感じがします＾＾（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！ 元気チャージっ(o^^o) ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の握手会、楽しみです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださる方は、よろしくお願いします（＿）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、またね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/21/3421637/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-11666":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"一瞬鼻に指突っ込んでるんじゃないかと思うけど違う。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや♡2013.4.23"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなからいじられるまあや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズムでは\n私たちカップルなんだよねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはダンスが上手だから\n一緒に踊っててすごい楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生になったら\nぐんと綺麗になるんだろうな(遠い目"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\n学校、稽古と...頑張ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、本当体力ないな。\nもういやーこんな自分いやよー\nバレエ習ってたときの\nからだに戻さないとー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きろー起きろー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちは元気いっぱい\nやる気じゅうぶんだがな！！！\nははははははははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねーねちゃーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねがヒールのある靴履くから\n身長がわからなくなってきた笑\nでも稽古のときはいつもの身長で\n安心するよおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまってるものは\nコンビニの里芋煮とひじきです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/25/1591632/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではおやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-nogi-55628":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　\nいかがお過ごしでしょうか？　\n　\nわたしは今、自宅で玄米が炊き上がるのを待っています。　\n枝豆と塩昆布をまぜておにぎりにして冷凍するんだ〜〜　\n　\n　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFNYY6PMGKSF7QET0TM5BKR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　\n　\n少し前の特番ロケの写真です☺︎　\n　\n　\n　\n　\nそういえば先ほど父方の祖父母に電話してみました高齢なので、心配していましたが\n元気そうでした　\n祖父は「風邪ひきやすいから、大丈夫？」と言ったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ、私あまり風邪ひかないよ、いつも元気な気がするよと伝えると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「じゃなくて、パパ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちの父のことを、　\n要するに息子のことを心配していました　\n　\n　\nまあたしかにそうかもしれないけどもう何歳だと思ってるのだろうと思いつつ、いつまでも息子は可愛いのでしょう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"祖父も、父も、普段口数の少ない人なので　"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"孫はちょっと微笑ましかったです　\n　\n　"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配なら自分で電話すればいいのにそれはしないらしい　\nなので孫が、「〜って言ってたよ」と伝えてあげました　\n　\n　\n　\n母方の祖母には電話が繋がらなかったので、メールをしました\n　\n　"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFNYZ8VVWGJ6SFB0BT0TQKQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう雪で散ってしまっているかもなぁ\n先日、お仕事の帰りに桜を見かけました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"桜にもいろいろな種類があって、早咲きの桜、遅咲きの桜と満開を迎えるタイミングはそれぞれです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一瞬でも春を感じられて、嬉しかったなぁ。\n　\n今年はお花見も難しいと思うので、みなさんにもおすそわけです。\n　\n　\n遅咲きの桜が満開になる頃、またお外でのんびりしながら眺められるときが来ますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"　\n　\n　\n今日は21:00〜dTVチャンネル・ひかりTVチャンネル＋「乃木坂46山崎怜奈　歴史のじかん」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあと22:50〜CBCラジオ「チュウモリ」内にて「乃木坂46山崎怜奈の『推しの1コマ』」　\n　\n　\n　\n明日は19:00〜bayfm「金つぶ」二時間生放送です！　\n　\n3番組とも、お楽しみに✨　\n　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHFNZ0BJ2QK8GN61M94HPBJE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れな　\n　\n　"}],"source":"archive"}}